@startuml
title UC13 - Heal Team - Test Cases

map "TC-UC13-01: Heal all Pokemon successfully" as TC1 {
  Test Case Number => TC-UC13-01
  Test Case Name => Successfully heal entire team at Pokemon Center
  Description => Verify all Pokemon are restored to full HP at healing station
  Preconditions => 1. Player is at a healing station \n 2. Team has Pokemon with reduced HP
  Test Case Input => Team: Charmander (HP 10/35), Pidgey (HP 0/25 fainted), Rattata (HP 15/20)
  Expected Output => 1. Charmander HP restored to 35/35 \n 2. Pidgey revived and HP restored to 25/25 \n 3. Rattata HP restored to 20/20 \n 4. Healing complete message displayed
  Steps => 1. Interact with healing station \n 2. Confirm healing request \n 3. System heals each Pokemon via HealingService \n 4. Verify Charmander HP = 35/35 \n 5. Verify Pidgey HP = 25/25 (revived) \n 6. Verify Rattata HP = 20/20 \n 7. Verify success message displayed
  Default Value Preserving => All Pokemon HP set to maximum, status effects cleared
}

map "TC-UC13-02: Heal when team is already healthy" as TC2 {
  Test Case Number => TC-UC13-02
  Test Case Name => Attempt heal when all Pokemon at full HP
  Description => Verify proper message when healing is unnecessary
  Preconditions => 1. Player is at a healing station \n 2. All Pokemon at full HP
  Test Case Input => Team: Charmander (HP 35/35), Pidgey (HP 25/25)
  Expected Output => 1. System displays "Team is already healthy" \n 2. No healing performed \n 3. Return to exploration
  Steps => 1. Interact with healing station \n 2. System checks team HP \n 3. All Pokemon at max HP \n 4. Verify message displayed \n 5. Verify return to exploration
  Default Value Preserving => No changes to Pokemon data
}

@enduml
